            "text": "<p>At <strong>ONREPEAT</strong>, we aim to get your order to you swiftly, safely, and seamlessly.</p><p>Orders ship within <strong>1–2 business days</strong>.</p><p>All items are packaged in our , designed with care for both your experience and the environment.<br/></p>",
